\\ UNIT 07: POLYNOMIAL FUNCTIONS

P = x^4 - 1;         \\ Define polynomial

degree(P)            \\ Degree
poldegree(P)         \\ Polynomial degree
polcoeff(P,2)        \\ Coefficient of x^2
pollead(P)           \\ Leading coefficient
polcontent(2*x^2+4*x+6) \\ Polynomial content
subst(P,x,2)         \\ Substitute x = 2
deriv(P)             \\ Differentiate
intformal(P)         \\ Formal integration
factor(P)            \\ Factor polynomial
polgcd(P,x^2-1)      \\ Polynomial GCD
polresultant(P,x^2-1) \\ Polynomial resultant
polroots(x^2-4)      \\ Find complex roots
polrootsreal(x^2-4)  \\ Find real roots
polrootsmod(x^2-1,7) \\ Find roots modulo 7
polcyclo(5)          \\ Fifth cyclotomic polynomial
